content.zh:
通过 model 接收外部快照，在 change 中回写 event.detail.values。用 initialValues 定义重置基线，reset(values) 可加载记录并建立新基线。

### 注册异步规则

在页面 onReady 注册函数，并在 data 中的规则通过名称引用；在基础示例的 Form 上增加 rules="{{rules}}"。

```js
onReady() {
  this.selectComponent('#form').setValidators({
    unique: async value => value === 'reserved' ? 'This name is reserved' : true,
  });
  this.setData({ rules: { value: [{ validator: 'unique' }] } });
}
```

content.en:
Synchronize model from event.detail.values in change. initialValues establishes the reset baseline; reset(values) loads a record and establishes a new baseline.

### Register an asynchronous rule

Register the function in Page onReady, reference its name from rules in data, and add rules="{{rules}}" to the basic Form.

```js
onReady() {
  this.selectComponent('#form').setValidators({
    unique: async value => value === 'reserved' ? 'This name is reserved' : true,
  });
  this.setData({ rules: { value: [{ validator: 'unique' }] } });
}
```

content.zh:
options 为各列选项数组，model 中存放每列选中的值。各列独立；需要随上一级变化刷新下一级时，由应用更新 options 或使用 Cascader。

### 调整并列选项

在页面方法中替换 options；模型中的每个值仍对应一列。

```js
this.setData({
  options: [[{ label: 'Small', value: 's' }, { label: 'Large', value: 'l' }],
    [{ label: 'Black', value: 'black' }, { label: 'White', value: 'white' }]],
  model: { value: ['s', 'black'] },
});
```

content.en:
options is an array of option arrays, and the model stores one value per column. Columns are independent; update options externally or use Cascader for dependent levels.

### Update independent columns

Replace options from a Page method; each model entry still corresponds to a column.

```js
this.setData({
  options: [[{ label: 'Small', value: 's' }, { label: 'Large', value: 'l' }],
    [{ label: 'Black', value: 'black' }, { label: 'White', value: 'white' }]],
  model: { value: ['s', 'black'] },
});
```

content.zh:
树节点默认通过 children 连接；children=[] 明确表示叶子。缺少 children 时触发 loadchildren，应用加载后替换 options。

### 异步补充子节点

在字段绑定 loadchildren；事件中读取 path、option，加载完成后替换页面 options。未知子节点先省略 children。

```xml
<rmp-field options="{{options}}" bind:loadchildren="loadChildren" />
```

在 Page 中加入下列本地加载示例；初始 options 的根节点不包含 children。此示例加载一层业务子项，真实接口可替换 Promise.resolve 的数据来源。

```js
onReady() {
  this.setData({ options: [{ label: 'Clothing', value: 'clothing' }] });
},
async loadChildren(event) {
  const { option } = event.detail;
  const children = await Promise.resolve([{ label: 'Shirts', value: 'shirts', children: [] }]);
  this.setData({ options: this.data.options.map(node =>
    node.value === option.value ? { ...node, children } : node) });
}
```

content.en:
Tree nodes use children by default; children=[] explicitly marks a leaf. Missing children emits loadchildren; load data externally and replace options.

### Load children externally

Bind loadchildren on the field. Read path/option, load children externally and replace Page options. Omit children while it is unknown.

```xml
<rmp-field options="{{options}}" bind:loadchildren="loadChildren" />
```

Add this local loading example to Page. The initial root has no children property. This example loads one level; replace the Promise.resolve data source with your business endpoint when needed.

```js
onReady() {
  this.setData({ options: [{ label: 'Clothing', value: 'clothing' }] });
},
async loadChildren(event) {
  const { option } = event.detail;
  const children = await Promise.resolve([{ label: 'Shirts', value: 'shirts', children: [] }]);
  this.setData({ options: this.data.options.map(node =>
    node.value === option.value ? { ...node, children } : node) });
}
```

content.zh:
不配置 adapter 时只选择本地文件。上传时在 Form.setUploadAdapters 注册名称，或在独立 Upload 上调用 setAdapter；适配器返回 {result,abort?}，进度通过 onProgress 上报。

### 手动上传

在示例字段添加 id="upload" 和 auto-upload="{{false}}"。在 Page 的 onReady 中给独立 Upload 注册适配器；连接 Form 时也可用 Form.setUploadAdapters。

```js
onReady() {
  const upload = this.selectComponent('#upload');
  upload.setAdapter((file, { onProgress }) => {
    let task;
    const result = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
      task = wx.uploadFile({ url: 'https://your-upload-domain.example/upload',
        filePath: file.tempFilePath, name: 'file',
        success: response => {
          try { resolve({ url: JSON.parse(response.data).url }); } catch (error) { reject(error); }
        }, fail: reject });
      task.onProgressUpdate(event => onProgress(event.progress));
    });
    return { result, abort: () => task.abort() };
  });
}
// In another Page handler: this.selectComponent('#upload').upload();
```

content.en:
Without an adapter, Upload only selects local files. Register a named adapter with Form.setUploadAdapters, or call setAdapter on a standalone Upload. An adapter returns {result,abort?} and reports progress through onProgress.

### Start uploads manually

Add id="upload" and auto-upload="{{false}}" to the field. Register an adapter in Page onReady; Form-connected fields may also resolve a named Form adapter.

```js
onReady() {
  const upload = this.selectComponent('#upload');
  upload.setAdapter((file, { onProgress }) => {
    let task;
    const result = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
      task = wx.uploadFile({ url: 'https://your-upload-domain.example/upload',
        filePath: file.tempFilePath, name: 'file',
        success: response => {
          try { resolve({ url: JSON.parse(response.data).url }); } catch (error) { reject(error); }
        }, fail: reject });
      task.onProgressUpdate(event => onProgress(event.progress));
    });
    return { result, abort: () => task.abort() };
  });
}
// In another Page handler: this.selectComponent('#upload').upload();
```

content.zh:
item.type="video" 时使用视频适配，否则显示图片。active 控制视频是否可以播放；itemevent 的 type 区分 soundon、mutedchange、playbacksummary 和 error。

### 转发媒体事件

在 rmp-item 上绑定 bind:itemevent="onItemEvent"，并将下面方法加到 Page。

```js
onItemEvent(event) {
  const { type, detail } = event.detail;
  console.log(type, detail);
}
```

content.en:
item.type="video" selects the video adapter; other items render as images. active controls whether video may play. itemevent.type distinguishes soundon, mutedchange, playbacksummary and error.

### Read media events

Bind bind:itemevent="onItemEvent" on rmp-item and add this method to Page.

```js
onItemEvent(event) {
  const { type, detail } = event.detail;
  console.log(type, detail);
}
```

content.zh:
items 可混合 {type:"image",src} 与 {type:"video",src,poster,muted}。只有激活的视频参与播放；mute() 静音本轮播中的媒体项。

### 关闭声音并切换

在 Page 的按钮事件中执行；不会影响轮播之外的视频。

```js
const gallery = this.selectComponent('#gallery');
gallery.mute();
gallery.next();
```

content.en:
items may mix {type:"image",src} and {type:"video",src,poster,muted}. Only the active video participates in playback. mute() mutes media in this carousel.

### Mute and advance

Run this from a Page button handler; videos outside this carousel are unaffected.

```js
const gallery = this.selectComponent('#gallery');
gallery.mute();
gallery.next();
```
